{"parse": {"title": "弗罗林", "pageid": 111814, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"弗罗林\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4a/CurrencyItem-30501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"弗罗林\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>弗罗林</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-30501 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/CurrencyIcon-30501_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-30501_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/CurrencyIcon-30501_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-30501_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/CurrencyIcon-30501_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-30501_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#30501</div></div><hr /><div>文艺复兴时期佛罗伦萨使用的铸币，通行于意大利半岛。可用于特别柜台兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">从街头医生到圣天使堡的领袖，没有人会拒绝闪闪发亮的金币。你已经知晓如何获得它，而关于如何使用，你熟悉的那位刺客有一些经验之谈。\n“蒙特里久尼庄园感谢您的慷慨。”</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "弗罗林"}}